{
    "background_story": "Sweetheart was a majestic chestnut mare with a unique feature - a condylar fracture in her left hind leg. Despite this injury, she never lost her spirit or her will to run. With careful rehabilitation and training, Sweetheart learned to adapt to her condition, developing a distinctive gait that became her trademark. Her owner, a skilled equine therapist, worked tirelessly to help Sweetheart overcome her physical limitations. As a result, Sweetheart became an inspiration to others, proving that even with imperfections, one can still achieve greatness. She went on to compete in therapeutic riding competitions, earning accolades and admiration from all who saw her. Sweetheart's story is a testament to the power of resilience, determination, and the unbreakable bond between humans and animals.",
